# Avitolog rules

- Scope all reads/writes by `project_id`. Never leak another project's settings or chat.
- New project → first assistant message «Давайте выполним настройку»; onboarding before creative pipeline.
- Orchestrator JSON must include `need_images`; do not rely on client `generate_images`.
- Approve → rebuild Autoload XML; metrics refresh only on explicit button.
- Push to `shurik782-a11y/AvitologAI` after meaningful changes.
